---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="数字实验室 · ORANGY ZC">
  <section class="page-shell">
    <span class="page-kicker">DIGITAL LAB</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">数字实验室</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      一些关于 AI、代码、数据与创意的交互实验。下面这四个是可以直接点开用的——都是作品集里项目的在线 demo，
      数据只存在你自己的浏览器里。
    </p>

    <div class="lab-grid">
      <a class="lab-item" href="/demo/workspace/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">
        <span class="lab-no">01</span>
        <b>个人工作台</b>
        <small>仪表板 · 新闻示例 · 任务与打卡（演示数据）</small>
      </a>
      <a class="lab-item" href="/demo/crawler/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">
        <span class="lab-no">02</span>
        <b>拾取 Harvester</b>
        <small>粘贴一个网址，看任务从扫描走到归档（模拟）</small>
      </a>
      <a class="lab-item" href="/demo/shanhai/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">
        <span class="lab-no">03</span>
        <b>山海司 · 巡荒录</b>
        <small>可直接开局的卡牌 demo</small>
      </a>
      <a class="lab-item" href="/demo/cardshop/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">
        <span class="lab-no">04</span>
        <b>卡牌店模拟经营</b>
        <small>开一间店，从进货开始（浏览器版）</small>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
